            </note>
            <note corresp="#d80-f2" n="1" xml:id="d80-f2-content">
                <p>For text of Secretary Dulles’ statement following his conversation with the
                    President, which included a reaffirmation of the U.S. position on Berlin, see
                    Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, December 22, 1958, p.
                    994.</p>
            </note>
